        {
          "id": "story/001/dialogue/01.03/0023",
          "source_speaker": "$n",
          "speaker": "$n",
          "source_text": "（初めての実戦…）",
          "text": "（第一次实战……）",
          "source_hex": "246e0a81698f8982df82c482cc8ec090ed8163816a",
          "hex": "246e0a8fe891e688ea8e9f91f8929e8fe08fe08feb"
        },
        {
          "id": "story/001/dialogue/01.03/0024",
          "source_speaker": "$n",
          "speaker": "$n",
          "source_text": "（やるんだ…。\n　私は軍人…私は兵士なんだ…！）",
          "text": "（我要战斗……我是军人……\n　是一名士兵……！）",
          "source_hex": "246e0a816982e282e982f182be816381420a81408e8482cd8c52906c81638e8482cd95ba8e6d82c882f182be81638149816a",
          "hex": "246e0a8fe889e49776929e936c8fe08fe089e490a590c4906c8fe08fe00a814090a588ea96bc8e6d95ba8fe08fe08fda8feb"
        },
        {
          "id": "story/001/dialogue/01.08/0013",
          "source_speaker": "カミーユ",
          "speaker": "卡缪",
          "source_text": "（あの新型が完成すれば、\n　ティターンズの戦力になる…。\n　それだけは防がなくては…！）",
          "text": "（那台新型机一旦完成，就会成为提坦斯\n　的战力……唯独这一点必须阻止……！）",
          "source_hex": "834a837e815b83860a816982a082cc90568c5e82aa8aae90ac82b782ea82ce81410a814083658342835e815b8393835982cc90ed97cd82c982c882e9816381420a814082bb82ea82be82af82cd966882aa82c882ad82c482cd81638149816a",
          "hex": "915895e10a8fe893df91e490568c5e8af788ea92558aae90ac8fd38f4189ef90ac926892f192528e7a0a81409349929e97cd8fe08fe0974293c6884988ea935f954b8878916a8e7e8fe08fe08fda8feb"
        },
        {
          "id": "story/001/dialogue/01.27/0000",
          "source_speaker": "デンゼル",
          "speaker": "丹泽尔",
          "source_text": "（連邦軍を掌握しつつあるティターンズに\n　対抗して生まれた組織、エゥーゴ…）",
          "text": "（奥古……为了对抗正在逐步掌控\n　联邦军的提坦斯而诞生的组织……）",
          "source_hex": "83668393835b838b0a81699841964d8c5282f08fb688ac82b582c282c282a082e983658342835e815b8393835982c90a814091ce8d5282b582c490b682dc82ea82bd91679044814183478344815b83538163816a",
          "hex": "924f94ee92470a8fe8899c8cc38fe08fe0926897b995d38d5290b38ddd928084fb8fb68d540a814095ec964d90c4934992f192528e7a8ea787d090b6934995a987838fe08fe08feb"
        },
        {
          "id": "story/001/dialogue/01.27/0001",
          "source_speaker": "デンゼル",
          "speaker": "丹泽尔",
          "source_text": "（確かに、このままでは軍は遠からず\n　ティターンズに牛耳られる事になる…）",
          "text": "（的确，照这样下去，用不了多久\n　军队就会被提坦斯彻底掌控……）",
          "source_hex": "83668393835b838b0a81698a6d82a982c9814182b182cc82dc82dc82c582cd8c5282cd899382a982e782b80a814083658342835e815b8393835982c98b8d8ea882e782ea82e98e9682c982c882e98163816a",
